[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Bats are aggressive flying creatures. <b>They can fly over water and
their speed is greater than Hearthling's running.</b>

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

They'll attack you if you get get close, and fellow bats in their gang (within a tile or two) will join in. If you're the one to attack only one will fight back. They don't fight with gang members, so you if equip a [[Bat Wing|bat cape]] they'll ignore you unless you attack them.

